When generating a Git commit message for this repository:

- Write the entire message in Russian.
- Keep it short: one subject line, about 50–60 characters, no period at the end.
- Add a body only if the change is non-obvious; then 1–2 short sentences, not a file-by-file restatement of the diff.
- Prefer imperative mood (добавить, исправить, вынести, упростить).
